OL,3,GNEWSABus station 'no longer feels safe'
OL,4,Aamid rough sleepers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disability transport campaigner says
OL,7,Fhe no longer feels safe at a city bus
OL,8,Fstation after he was threatened and
OL,9,Fspat on while waiting for a bus.
OL,11,FBrendon Taylor said people had begged
OL,12,Fhim for money and even attempted to
OL,13,Fsteal from him while travelling from
OL,14,FBristol Bus Station.
OL,16,FFirst Bus, which manage the site, said
OL,17,Fit was reviewing its security
OL,18,Farrangements following increasing
OL,19,Freports of rough sleepers and
OL,20,Fantisocial behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
