OL,3,GNEWSABus station 'no longer feels safe'
OL,4,Aamid rough sleepers
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have also called upon the
OL,7,FWest of England Combined Authority
OL,8,F(Weca) to introduce dedicated transport
OL,9,Fsafety officers. A Weca spokesperson
OL,10,Fsaid it was working with partners to
OL,11,Fensure people experiencing homelessness
OL,12,Faccess accommodation.
